        "id": "2060104120045019171",
        "text": "wow… 6 months later, Opus 4.8 nails the boeing747-using-THREEJS-primitives benchmark. Single prompt (in ultracode effort):\n\nBuilt the geometry and a rig to screenshot the result from 9 angles, ran a critic per angle, debugged itself (a crash, then a wing-sweep bug that floated the engines), looped 7× to this result in 25 minutes🤯",
